<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">19052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Gulf capitals have stopped a planned American airstrike on Iran.</s> <s>Qatar, Saudi Arabia, and the United Arab Emirates — the three states that host US military bases — persuaded Washington to stand down after Trump ordered his forces ready on Tuesday.</s> <s>The countries Washington once protected are now setting the limits of its wars.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan has deployed sixteen fighter jets and eight thousand troops to Saudi Arabia under a mutual-defence pact.</s> <s>The force includes a Chinese-made HQ-nine air-defence battery, placing Beijing's systems side by side with American ones on Saudi soil.</s> <s>A nuclear-armed Sunni power has formally extended its umbrella over the Gulf, in a way US security guarantees no longer can.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>One worshipper was shot dead at a San Diego mosque on Monday, and two gunmen killed themselves nearby.</s> <s>Children at the campus Al-Rashid school were evacuated safely, police said.</s> <s>Officers haven't stated a motive, and the centre remains closed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China has made Uyghur religious life a state secret.</s> <s>A March first regulation extends national-secrecy law to religious practice and cultural expression in Xinjiang, embedding information control into an already dense surveillance system.</s> <s>Journalists, exile families, and defence lawyers now face criminal exposure for documenting what was once publicly known.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Libya, Syrian refugees are weighing return to a post-Assad homeland that's physically destroyed but politically transformed.</s> <s>Conscription has ended, but so have their houses... and the legal architecture that protected Syrians abroad is being quietly unwound from Ankara to Berlin.</s> <s>The phrase "the war is over" is becoming a policy lever for forced returns, even where conditions for return aren't yet there.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Four people were killed in Kenyan fuel protests on Monday.</s> <s>Iran's closure of the Strait of Hormuz has driven shortages from South Africa to Madagascar, hitting states with no fiscal buffer to absorb the shock.</s> <s>Malawi's planting season is collapsing as fertiliser sits blocked at port, and Madagascar has declared a state of emergency.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's quarterly budget reports are months overdue.</s> <s>The Budget Office says re-enactment of the twenty twenty-five Appropriation Act extended the fiscal year to June, legally delaying publication.</s> <s>For a country borrowing heavily against future revenue, opacity in budget execution raises the cost of every new bond.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Vladimir Putin has landed in Beijing with one concrete ask — unlock the Power of Siberia two gas pipeline, fifty billion cubic metres a year locked into China for decades.</s> <s>Sanctions pushed Russia from being Europe's swing supplier to a price-taker bargaining with Beijing.</s> <s>Moscow is now signalling it'll accept gas at close to Chinese domestic prices, which is what Xi has wanted all along.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Europe's largest budget carrier is now openly pricing the Iran war into fares.</s> <s>Ryanair locked eighty percent of its fuel before Hormuz closed, but the remaining twenty percent now tracks Brent's risk premium, and chief Michael O'Leary said the same cost hits every European carrier regardless of route.</s> <s>The airline cut its summer guidance to broadly flat and withheld a full-year profit outlook.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>An asteroid passed inside the moon's orbit on Monday, detected only days before its approach.</s> <s>Near-Earth objects this size can't be resolved by survey systems until they're already inbound, leaving essentially no window for deflection.</s> <s>NASA's OSIRIS-APEX probe, en route to study Apophis in twenty twenty-nine, now faces cancellation under proposed budget cuts.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A rare strain of Ebola has crossed from the Democratic Republic of Congo into Uganda.</s> <s>Kampala has cancelled a major pilgrimage as contact tracers race to catch it, and the strain is rare enough that existing vaccines and monoclonal antibody stockpiles may not match.</s> <s>East Africa's cross-border outbreak surveillance has been quietly degraded by the dismantling of USAID.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A global analysis of one hundred thirty-three species — fish, birds, mammals, reptiles, insects — finds that urban populations are consistently bolder, more aggressive, and more exploratory than their rural counterparts.</s> <s>This is convergent behavioural evolution playing out in real time as cities reshape selection pressures.</s> <s>Urbanisation now sits on the same shortlist of evolutionary forces as climate change and habitat loss.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pope Leo the fourteenth will release his first major encyclical on artificial intelligence on the twenty-fifth of May, presented at the Vatican alongside Anthropic co-founder Chris Olah.</s> <s>A church of one-point-four billion members is consciously lending legitimacy to, and borrowing legitimacy from, a frontier lab whose own leaders warn about existential risk.</s> <s>It arrives just as governments are deferring AI governance to the labs themselves.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Standard Chartered will eliminate seven thousand eight hundred back-office roles by twenty thirty, blaming AI adoption directly.</s> <s>The bank's back office is concentrated in India, Malaysia, and the Philippines — so "AI replacing back office" means tens of thousands of middle-class jobs disappearing across Asian financial hubs.</s> <s>A London-headquartered bank is the named actor; the workers absorbing the displacement are five thousand miles away.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mexico's sanctioned-supplier list has trained a fraud-detection model that flags corrupt government contracts.</s> <s>Training on the government's banned-firm list solved machine learning's core problem here — no certified clean examples exist in procurement data, so the dirty list does the work.</s> <s>Shared directors and bid-clustering proved the strongest predictors, and researchers say the method ports to any government with a black list.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Armed groups in Colombia are recruiting children on TikTok with content that promises belonging, money, and adventure.</s> <s>Recruitment videos are tagged, algorithmically promoted, and reach minors well before any state programme does.</s> <s>US-owned platforms moderate ISIS-style content aggressively, but treat narco-paramilitary recruitment as a local crime story.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>